{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>藝人陳煒於11月21日迎來53歲生日兼入行30週年，獲大批粉絲豪花重金包下多區大型屏幕強勢應援。她當日親自落區打卡時遭大批人群包圍，更在鬧市中發生一段小插曲。這位資深演員面對突如其來震撼場面展現出最真實一面。</p>\n<h2>陳煒落區巡遊三地打卡引發熱議</h2>\n<p>為了慶祝偶像入行30載這個重要里程碑，一班忠實支持者特別租下旺角、尖沙咀及銅鑼灣鬧市巨型戶外LED屏幕，全天候循環播放她過去多部經典劇集演出片段。陳煒當日手持生日氣球親自走訪三區屏幕前留影，現場早有大批帶備應援牌守候多時。她不但親民地與在場人士握手及比心心合照，更親自拿起手機與眾人自拍，期間一眾支持者在銅鑼灣街頭齊聲大唱生日歌為她祝壽。</p>\n<h2>壽星女發文親述街頭慶生真實感受</h2>\n<p>面對如此盛大慶祝活動，陳煒事後在社交平台發文寫下長篇生日感言，坦言被眾人在鬧市高歌舉動弄得百感交集。她於帖文中表示：「昨天絕對是人生中一次難忘嘅生日，感謝粉絲破費投了旺角、尖沙咀、銅鑼灣三個大屏幕為我祝壽。」她更特別提到當時心聲：「fans們大大聲在鬧市唱生日歌，搞到我很尷尬，但亦好感動。」她同時感謝專誠從馬來西亞、杭州及上海等地飛抵香港參與快閃打卡活動。</p>\n<h2>旺角尖沙咀銅鑼灣屏幕應援極震撼</h2>\n<p>這次街頭大屏幕應援覆蓋範圍極廣，畫面印有「入行三十載幕幕盛放」及「宇宙盡頭有你就夠」等字句，正正印證著她多年來在演藝圈默默耕耘所累積下來強大觀眾緣。這種以往多見於年輕偶像身上大型街頭應援文化，如今出現在這位資深演員身上，吸引大批途人駐足觀看及拍照留念。活動當日除了本地支持者外，更聚集不少海外面孔共同參與快閃打卡。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚保養得宜極具親和力</h2>\n<p>這次盛大生日應援片段在網上曝光後，隨即引發大批網民熱烈討論。許多網民對於粉絲用心籌備感到震撼，紛紛留言指出這場生日慶祝活動規模龐大，直指「排場絕不輸時下年輕偶像」。不少人亦留意到她在街頭與眾人打成一片溫馨互動，大讚她毫無架子極具親和力。大批網民持續在相關帖文下留言送上生日祝福，令討論熱度不斷攀升。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542240101029113_4587540676b03f8c1a6fae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542240101029113_4587540676b03f8c1a6fae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542240410468529_4548809986b03f8c494434.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"zpcT2Ta6JwS0PLOGv45nobIJcFBaz3OUt7xsFbe8bBU.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542240410468529_4548809986b03f8c494434.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542240675713365_4415193716b03f8c71e422.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"DFMhoNhJYDlUmNRwTx1su9GfZX1uXLFeOK-l4jivpeI.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542240675713365_4415193716b03f8c71e422.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954224090337800_1138225126b03f8c9a8d30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sn0QmRZviHHmKnSvJ0cgMdAIs88R9TObdK3a7XSt2u0.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954224090337800_1138225126b03f8c9a8d30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542241361728968_14432275546b03f8cef2222.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wnao6bQBcPP1Tm2CXte8RXKA4rhs5cYt2VcUWNlXFFg.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542241361728968_14432275546b03f8cef2222.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542242050022161_9508030286b03f8d4d7610.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lu7MZqr0REZiRWVafSfbJRlVVBGYKozs9TIejPUyHow.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542242050022161_9508030286b03f8d4d7610.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542242270048005_5818555736b03f8d712d9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"37S59_6HbI2o38NJaJgbOGUydpVY8u8XIzNGpyMzRqc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542242270048005_5818555736b03f8d712d9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:43:17.947263+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1198,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:27:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:36:50.430846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:36:50.430846+00:00","content_hash":"284b7f04e725df8edfd2dc637559b6e80affaf6e92d7bcf09981